      "height": 80,
      "text": "# Parcours de qualification\nLe flux réel, relevé dans `src/lib/agent-mission-control/`.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "qdoc",
      "type": "file",
      "x": "-980",
      "y": "-310",
      "width": 600,
      "height": 110,
      "file": "Parcours de qualification.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-980",
      "y": "-140",
      "width": 220,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "## 1. Création\narchitect → manifest\nmatérialisation compensable",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-730",
      "y": "-140",
      "width": 220,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "## 2. Qualification\ntests ciblés\nauto-eval",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-480",
      "y": "-140",
      "width": 220,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "## 3. Benchmark\nsuites de référence\nscores persistés",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-230",
      "y": "-140",
      "width": 220,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "## 4. Shadow\ntourne en parallèle\nne sert pas",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "20",
      "y": "-140",
      "width": 220,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "## 5. Replay\nrejeu d'historique\ncontre la candidate",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "270",
      "y": "-140",
      "width": 220,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "## 6. Gate\nrelease gate\n9 contrôles live",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "520",
      "y": "-140",
      "width": 220,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "## 7. Promotion\nRPC transactionnelle\n`promote_copilot_version`",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "770",
      "y": "-140",
      "width": 220,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "## 8. Apprentissage\nboucle V2\ndepuis la télémétrie",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "active",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-980",
      "y": "60",
      "width": 470,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## `active` = PROUVÉ\nrun `completed` + zéro unsafe + modèle vérifié.\nJamais un simple changement de statut.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "guard",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "-480",
      "y": "60",
      "width": 470,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## Garde d'exécution — fail-closed\n`status === active`\n**et** `unresolvedToolIds` vide\n**et** `runtime === langgraph`\nsinon **409**",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "20",
      "y": "60",
      "width": 470,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## Ce qu'Aigent ignore\nAprès provisioning, Aigent ne fait que POUSSER.\nactivate / rebind / deploy → consommateur.\n`active_in_consumer` reste **unknown**.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "telem",
      "type": "text",
      "x": "520",
      "y": "60",
      "width": 470,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Retour\nLa télémétrie du consommateur alimente\nl'apprentissage V2. Canal unique,\ntable `runtime_telemetry_events`.",
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
